+// destination of a GPU copy or clear, not used by a texture ID or a texture-object lookup for DM_NVN_EVICT_IDLE submissions (default 1800, about 7 s at four a frame; 0 turns it off).
+// The next lookup rebuilds it on the slow path (tex_mtl_ -> tex_init_fill). Steps as mtl_alias_drop_pool, plus the serial table, the view caches of its serials and idle texture IDs' views
